!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = sgRNA libraries were prepared by PCR amplification to add sequencing adapters and indices followed by SPRI beads purification of sequencing-ready amplicons.
!Sample_description = processed data file: Nalm6_sgRNA_read_counts.txt
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were aligned using Bowtie2.2.5 in the forward direction only (--norc option) with otherwise default parameters and total read counts per sgRNA were tabulated.
!Sample_data_processing = Read counts from different sequencing lanes for the same sample were summed.
!Sample_data_processing = Read counts from all control samples and time-points from each experiment were summed.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: For Nalm-6 screens: EKO sgRNA library (Bertomeu et al. 2017, PMID:29038160), using only the core gene-targting sgRNA set of of the library. For Jurkat screens: TKOv3 sgRNA library (Hart et al. 2017,PMID:28655737).
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Tab-separated sgRNA read counts per sample
